 ("Evidence from a text should be:", ["A specific detail that supports your point", "Your opinion only", "A guess", "A detail from a different story"], 0, "Evidence is a specific detail from the text."),
 ("The literal meaning of a passage is:", ["What the words directly say", "A hidden symbol only", "The author's biography", "The title"], 0, "Literal means what the words directly say."),
